 "caveats": [
  "OUT-OF-SAMPLE STATUS IS PER MEMBER, not per union: the deep-ensemble member was trained over the whole grid (so its contribution to a held-out fold is NOT out-of-sample), while each NFF member holds out its own folds - recorded per member under 'members' above, read from that member's own report.json.  A fold on which a member is in-sample is disclosed here rather than described as held out.",
